{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"宰相世系三","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"柳氏出自姬姓。魯孝公子夷伯展孫無駭生禽，字季，為魯士師，諡曰惠，食采於柳下，","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"遂姓柳氏。楚滅魯，仕楚。秦并天下，柳氏遷於河東。秦末，柳下惠裔孫安，始居解縣","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。安孫隗，漢齊相。六世孫豐，後漢光祿勳。六世孫軌，晉吏部尚書。生景猷，晉侍中","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。二子：耆、純。耆，太守，號「西眷」。耆二子：恭、璩。恭，後魏河東郡守，南徙","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"汝、潁，遂仕江表。曾孫緝，宋州別駕、宋安郡守。生僧習，與豫州刺史裴叔業據州歸","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"於後魏，為揚州大中正、尚書右丞、方輿公。五子：鷟、慶、虯、檜、鸑。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"柳氏宰相三人。奭、璨、渾。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"柳氏表","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"韓氏出自姬姓。晉穆侯沸少子曲沃桓叔成師生武子萬，食采韓原，生定伯，定伯生子輿","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，子輿生獻子厥，從封，遂為韓氏。十五世孫襄王倉，為秦所滅。少子蟣虱，生信，漢","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"封韓王。生弓高侯頹當。頹當生孺。孺生案道侯說。說生長君。長君生龍額侯增。增生","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"河南尹騫，避王莽亂，居赭陽。九世孫河東太守術，生河東太守純。純生魏司徒南鄉恭","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"侯暨。六世孫延之，字顯宗，後魏魯陽侯。孫瓌，平涼太守，安定公。生恒州刺史演。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"演生褒。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"韓氏宰相四人。瑗、休、滉、弘。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"韓氏表","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"來氏出自子姓。商之支孫食采於郲，因以為氏，其後避難去「邑」。秦末徙新野。漢有","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"光祿大夫來漢，從楊僕擊南越。孫仲，諫議大夫。生歙，字君叔，中郎將。生稜。稜生","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"歷，為執金吾。生定，中郎將。孫豔，司空。生敏，字敬達，蜀執慎將軍。七世孫崱，","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"始徙江都。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"崱。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"繪。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"護兒，隋左翊衛大將軍、榮國公。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"恒，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"景業，虞部郎中。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"濟，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"敬業，潤州刺史。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"慶遠，中書舍人。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"來氏宰相二人。濟、恒。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"許氏出自姜姓。炎帝裔孫伯夷之後，周武王封其裔孫文叔於許，後以為太嶽之嗣，至元","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"公結為楚所滅，遷於容城，子孫分散，以國為氏。自容城徙冀州高陽北新城都鄉樂善里","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。秦末有許猗，隱居不仕。曾孫毗，漢侍中、太常。生德，字伯饒，安定、汝南太守，","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"因居平輿。四子：據、政、邈、勁。據，大司農。生允，字士崇，魏中領軍、鎮北將軍","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。三子：殷、動、猛。允孫式，式二子：販、邁。販字仲仁，晉司徒掾。四子：茂、詢","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"、嶷、雅。詢字玄度，四子：元之、仲之、季之、珪。珪，宋給事、著作郎、桂陽太守","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。生勇慧，齊太子家令、冗從僕射、晉陵縣侯。二子：懋、胤。懋，梁天門太守、中庶","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"子，生亨。德次子政，字義先，別居邵陵。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"許氏宰相二人。敬宗、圉師。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"許氏表","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"辛氏出自姒姓。夏后啟封支子於莘，「莘」「辛」聲相近，遂為辛氏。周太史辛甲為文","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"王臣，封於長子。秦有將軍辛騰，家於中山苦陘。曾孫蒲，漢初以豪族徙隴西狄道。曾","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孫柔，字長汎，光祿大夫、右扶風都尉、馮翊太守。四子：臨、衆、武賢、登翁。武賢","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，破羌將軍。生慶忌，左將軍、光祿大夫、常樂公。生子產，豫章太守。曾孫茂，後漢","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"成義將軍、酒泉太守、侍中。三子：緘、述、孟孫。孟孫生長水校尉伯真。伯真二子：","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孟興、叔興。孟興二子：恩、殷。恩生子焉。子焉三子：寅、裕、胥。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"辛氏宰相一人。茂將。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"辛氏表","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"任姓出自黃帝少子禹陽，受封於任，因以為姓。十二世孫奚仲，為夏車正，更封於薛。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"又十二世孫仲虺，為湯左相。太戊時有臣扈，武丁時有祖巳，皆徙國於邳。祖巳七世孫","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"成侯，又遷於摯，亦謂之摯國。漢有御史大夫廣阿侯任敖，世居於沛，其後徙居渭南。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"雅相，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"雅相，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"鵬，陵州刺史。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"迪簡，易定節度使。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"憲字亞司。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"任氏宰相一人。雅相。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"盧氏出自姜姓。齊文公子高，高孫傒為齊正卿，諡曰敬仲，食采於盧，濟北盧縣是也，","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"其後因以為氏。田和篡齊，盧氏散居燕、秦之間。秦有博士敖，子孫家於涿水之上，遂","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"為范陽涿人。裔孫植，字子幹，漢北中郎將。生毓，字子象，魏司空、容城成侯。三子","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"：欽、簡、珽。欽，晉尚書僕射。珽字子笏，晉侍中尚書、廣燕穆子。三子：浮、皓、","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"志。志字子道，晉中書監、衛尉卿。三子：諶、謐、詵。諶字子諒，晉侍中、中書監。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"五子：勗、凝、融、偃、徵。勗居巷南，號「南祖」。偃居北，號「北祖」。偃仕慕容","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"氏，營丘太守。二子：邈、闡。邈，范陽太守。生玄，字子真，後魏中書侍郎、固安宣","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"侯。二子：巡、度世。度世字子遷，青州刺史固安惠侯。四子：陽烏、敏、昶、尚之，","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"號「四房盧氏」。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"盧氏宰相八人。大房有商、承慶；第二房有翰、邁；第三房有懷慎、杞；范陽有○、光","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"啟。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"盧氏表","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"上官氏出自羋姓。楚王子蘭為上官大夫，以族為氏。漢徙大姓以實關中，上官氏徙隴西","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"上邽。漢有右將軍安陽侯桀，生安，車騎將軍、桑樂侯，以反伏誅。遺腹子期，裔孫勝","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，蜀太尉。二子：曰茂、曰先。先徙東郡，後徙陝郡。五世孫回。至弘為江都總監，又","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"徙揚州。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"回，後周襄城太守。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"弘，隋比部郎中、江都總監。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"儀字游韶，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"庭芝，周王府屬，天水郡公。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"庭璋，太子僕。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"經野，德州刺史。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"經國。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"經緯。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"詔，侍御史。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"上官氏宰相一人。儀。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"樂氏出自子姓。宋戴公生公子衎，字樂父，生傾父澤，澤生夷父須，子孫以王父字為氏","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。須生大司寇樂呂，呂孫喜，喜生司城子罕。裔孫樂羊，為魏文侯將，封於靈壽，其後","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"子孫因家焉。裔孫毅，趙封望諸君。毅孫臣叔，漢封華成君，子孫自趙徙長陵。裔孫親","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，後漢本縣吏。生恢字伯奇，尚書僕射。生羽林監乾，徙南陽淯陽。孫仁，為武陵太守","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。生清河太守平。平生散騎常侍方。生廣，字彥輔，晉尚書令、信陵公。裔孫恂。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"恂，梁西揚州刺史。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"亮，後周固道郡守。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"宗，青城令。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"彥瑋字德珪，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"思順，白水令。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"思晦，相武后。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"樂氏宰相二人。彥瑋、思晦。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孫氏出自姬姓。衛康叔八世孫武公和生公子惠孫，惠孫生耳，為衛上卿，食采於戚，生","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"武仲乙，以王父字為氏。乙生昭子炎，炎生莊子紇，紇生宣子○，○生桓子良夫，良夫","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"生文子林父，林父生嘉，世居汲郡。晉有孫登，即其裔也。又有出自羋姓。楚蚡冒生王","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"子蒍章，字無鉤，生蒍叔伯呂臣，孫蒍賈伯嬴生蒍艾獵，即令尹叔敖，亦為孫氏。又有","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"出自媯姓。齊田完字敬仲，四世孫桓子無宇，無宇二子：恒、書。書字子占，齊大夫，","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"伐莒有功，景公賜姓孫氏，食采於樂安。生憑，字起宗，齊卿。憑生武，字長卿，以田","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"、鮑四族謀為亂，奔吳，為將軍。三子：馳、明、敵。明食采於富春，自是世為富春人","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"。明生髕，髕生勝，字國輔，秦將。勝生蓋，字光道，漢中守。生知，字萬方，封武信","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"君。知生念，字甚然，二子：豐、益。益字玄器，生卿，字伯高，漢侍中。生憑，字景","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"純，將軍。二子：屆、詢。詢字會宗，安定太守。二子：鸞、騏。鸞生爰居，爰居生福","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，為太原太守，遇赤眉之難，遂居太原中都。太原之族有嵐州刺史昉，生存進，安定太","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"守。詢次子騏，字士龍，安邑令。二子：通、敻。通子孫世居清河，後魏有清河太守靈","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"懷。武德中，子孫因官徙汝州郟城。靈懷曾孫茂道。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孫氏宰相二人。清河有茂道。武邑有偓。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孫氏表","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"姜姓本炎帝，生於姜水，因以為姓。其後子孫變易他姓。堯遭洪水，共工之從孫佐禹治","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"水，為四嶽之官，以其主四嶽之祭，尊之，故稱曰「大嶽」，命為侯伯，復賜以祖姓曰","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"姜，以紹炎帝之後。裔孫太公望封齊，為田和所滅，子孫分散。漢初，姜氏以關東大族","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"徙關中，遂居天水。蜀大將軍平襄侯維，裔孫明，世居上邽。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"姜氏宰相二人。恪、公輔。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"姜氏表","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"陸氏出自媯姓。田完裔孫齊宣王少子通，字季達，封於平原般縣陸鄉，即陸終故地，因","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"以氏焉。通諡曰元侯，生恭侯發，為齊上大夫。發二子：萬、皐。皐生邕，邕生漢太中","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"大夫賈。萬生烈，字伯元，吳令、豫章都尉，旣卒，吳人思之，迎其喪，葬於胥屏亭，","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"子孫遂為吳郡吳縣人。二子：衡、盱。盱字子光，襄賁令。生鴻，字叔鸞，本州從事。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"鴻生建，字公榮，渤海太守。建生曄，字奉光，本州從事。生恭，字彥祖，御史中丞、","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"京兆尹。恭生璜，字公伯。璜生文，字孝平，弘農都尉。文生親，字公道，成都令。親","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"生衆，字世業，舉秀才，除郎中。生賜，字思祖，丞相府主簿。生閎，字子春，潁川太","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"守、尚書令。三子：卬、溫、桓，號潁川枝。桓字叔文，生續，字知初，揚州別駕。三","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"子：稠、逢、褒，號荊州枝。稠，荊州刺史。二子：肅、謙。肅，丹徒令，號丹徒枝。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"十世孫鎮之。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"陸氏宰相六人。丹徒枝有敦信；太尉枝有元方、象先、希聲；侍郎枝有扆、贄。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"陸氏表","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"趙氏出自嬴姓。顓頊裔孫伯益，帝舜賜以嬴姓。十三世孫造父，周穆王封於趙城，因以","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"為氏。其地河東永安縣是也。六世孫奄父，號公仲，生叔帶，去周仕晉文侯。五世孫夙","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，晉獻公賜采邑於耿，河東皮氏縣有耿鄉是也。夙生共孟，共孟生衰，字子餘，諡曰成","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"季。成季十八世孫遷，為秦所滅，趙人立遷兄嘉為代王，後降於秦。秦使嘉子公輔主西","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"戎，西戎懷之，號曰趙王，世居隴西天水西縣。公輔十二世孫融，字長，後漢右扶風、","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"大鴻臚。融七世孫瑤。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"趙氏宰相四人。仁本、憬、彥昭、宗儒。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"趙氏表","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"閻氏出自姬姓。周武王封太伯曾孫仲弈於閻鄉，因以為氏。又云，昭王少子生而手文曰","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"「閻」，康王封於閻城。又云，唐叔虞之後晉成公子懿，食采於閻邑，晉滅，子孫散處","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"河洛，前漢末，居滎陽。尚書閻章生暢，侍中、北宜春侯。三子：顯、景、晏。顯，車","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"騎將軍、長社侯。顯生穆，避難徙於巴西之安漢。顯孫甫，魏武帝封為平樂鄉侯，復居","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"河南新安。生牂柯太守璞，璞生晉殿中將軍、漢中太守讚。讚生遼西太守亨。亨生北平","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"太守安成亭侯鼎，字玉鉉，死劉聦之難。子昌，奔於代王猗盧，遂居馬邑。孫滿，後魏","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"諸曹大夫，自馬邑又徙河南。孫善，龍驤將軍、雲中鎮將，因居雲州盛樂。生車騎將軍","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"、燉煌鎮都大將提，提生盛樂郡守進。進少子慶，字仁度，後周小司空、上柱國、石保","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"成公，賜姓大野氏，至隋復舊。生毗。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"閻氏宰相一人。立本。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"閻氏表","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"郝氏出自郝省氏，太昊之佐也。商帝乙之世，裔孫期封於太原之郝鄉，因以為氏。裔孫","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"晏，秦上卿。晏孫瑗，太原守。生夔，漢匈奴中郎將。裔孫晉末因官徙潤州丹楊。七世","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"孫迴，自丹楊徙安陸。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"迴，梁江夏太守。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"破敵，後周沔州太守。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"相貴，滁州刺史。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"處俊，相高宗。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"北叟，司諫郎。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"南容，祕書郎。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"處傑，鄜州刺史。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"郝氏宰相一人。處俊。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"薛氏出自任姓。黃帝孫顓頊少子陽封於任，十二世孫奚仲為夏車正，禹封為薛侯，其地","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"魯國薛縣是也。奚仲遷於邳，十二世孫仲虺，復居薛，為湯左相。臣扈、祖巳皆其冑裔","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"也。祖巳七世孫曰成，徙國於摯，更號摯國。女大任，生周文王，至武王克商，復封為","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"薛侯。齊桓霸諸侯，獨薛侯不從，黜為伯。歷三代，凡六十四世，其可記者：畛生初，","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"初生厲侯陵，陵生宣武侯房，房生哀侯褒，褒生莊侯元，元生平侯貴，貴生昭侯直，直","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"生襄侯夷，夷生桓侯辨，辨生康侯安興，安興生定公箱，箱生恭侯尚，尚生景侯魏，魏","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"生宣侯伯勤，伯勤生簡侯文歡，文歡生惠侯夷黃，夷黃生靈侯英，英生文侯俱，俱生隱","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"侯清，清生愍侯洪，為楚所滅。公子登仕楚懷王為沛公，不仕，隱於博徒，因以國為氏","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，所謂薛公也。生雲，雲生卬，卬生倪，為楚令尹。倪生翁，翁生鑒，漢初獻策滅黥布","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，封千戶侯。生瑑，瑑生茂宣，茂宣生懷則，懷則生引孫，引孫生廣德，字廣德，御史","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"大夫。廣德生饒，長沙太守。饒生願，為淮陽太守，因徙居焉。生方丘，字夫子。方丘","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"生漢，字公子，後漢千乘太守。漢生彪，字輔國，司徒祭酒。彪生侍御史安期，安期生","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"中山相脩，脩生馬邑都尉山塗，山塗生山陽大守固，固生龍丘令文伯，文伯生東海相衍","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，衍生兗州別駕蘭，為曹操所殺。子永，字茂長，從蜀先主入蜀，為蜀郡太守。永生齊","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"，字夷甫，巴、蜀二郡太守，蜀亡，率戶五千降魏，拜光祿大夫，徙河東汾陰，世號蜀","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"薛。二子：懿、始。懿字元伯，一名奉，北地太守，襲鄢陵侯。三子：恢、雕、興。恢","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"一名開，河東太守，號「北祖」；雕號「南祖」；興，「西祖」。雕生徒，徒六子：堂","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"、暉、推、煥、渠、黃。堂生廣，晉上黨太守，生安都。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"薛氏定著二房：一曰南祖，二曰西祖。宰相三人。南祖有訥；西祖有稷、元超。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_72_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_72","textTraditional":"薛氏表","sentenceOrder":178}],"overrides":{}}